Concrete correction: 
Instead of using `rows.sort`, consider using a library like `lodash` or `fast-sort` which provides a more performant implementation.

Regression example:
```typescript
// Before
rows.sort((a, b) => a.time > b.time ? 1 : -1);

// After
import { orderBy } from 'lodash';

rows = orderBy(rows, ['time'], ['desc']);
```
